DESCRIPTION:CCCHR Presents January - Mystery Cruise Postponed Due to WEATHE
 R DATE TBD Saturday\, February 21st | 9:30a-2p Meet at Greenbriar Mall - I
 nfront of the Old Sears Building at 9:30a 1401 Greenbrier Pkwy\, Chesapeak
 e\, VA 23320 Come join us for the January Mystery Cruise. OPEN TO ALL CLUB
 S\, MEMBERS\, AND SOLO RIDERS! ALL MAKES AND MODELS! bring the daily and l
 et's ride! Our route will be provided in the morning before we depart. Thi
 s is a great way to meet new friends\, get your car/truck out of winter st
 orage and have some fun. We will meet at Greenbrier Mall at 0930 in front 
 of the old Sears\, with a departure at 1000 for our destination. Come with
  a full tank of fuel. This trip will be approximately 2 hours one way to o
 ur destination. We will divide up into groups of 5-7 cars with a lead car 
 who is responsible for that group. This Mystery Cruise will be canceled in
  the event of inclement weather. This is a Sunshine only event!! @media sc
