SUMMARY:8th Annual George E Smith Memorial Car Show and Swap Meet | Mar 28t
 h
LOCATION:Landstown Commons Shopping Center\, 3312 Princess Anne Road\, Virg
 inia Beach\, VA\, 23456
DESCRIPTION:8th Annual George E Smith Memorial Car Show and Swap Meet Satur
 day\, March 28 | 10a-3p @media screen and (max-width: 767px) { } @media sc
 reen and (max-width: 767px) { } @media screen and (max-width: 767px) { } R
 egister Here Join us as we celebrate the memory of a local car enthusiast 
 who passed away December 28\, 2018. George was a vital part of the Landsto
 wn Cruise-Ins\, and we are proud to remember him with an annual event. Geo
 rge also served on the board of the Beachcomber Corvette Club served as th
 e president of the Car Club Council of Hampton Roads. This will be an all 
 years\, makes\, and models event with awards. Beach Restomods is hosting a
  Swap Meet in the lot in conjunction with the show benefitting charity! Po
 rtion of proceeds will benefit a charity that George believed in\, the Sou
 theastern Food Bank. We will be accepting all non perishable food items fo
 r the food bank. Proceeds will also benefit the Car Club Council of Hampto
 n Roads as we work on improved events for all of our attendees. This event
  is hosted by 757 Auto Events and the Car Club Council of Hampton Roads. V
 endors: AWARDS: | 20 OUTSTANDING MODERN BUILDS | 20 OUTSTANDING CLASSIC BU
 ILDS | BEST IN SHOW - OVERALL | BEST IN SHOW - RUNNER UP | Beachcombers Co
 rvette Club of Virginia CHOICE | Car Club Council of Hampton Roads CHOICE 
