 NATION | LARGEST FOOD DONATION - RUNNER UP Sponsorship includes space for 
 a 10x10 booth. ZR1 - AWARD SPONSORSHIP $300 Z06 Sponsors $150 Stingray Spo
 nsor $100 Pre-registration saves you money! | $16 Car Show PreRegistration
