LOCATION:Portsmouth Olde Towne Farmers Market\, 400 High Street\, Portsmout
 h\, VA\, 23704
DESCRIPTION:(Weekly) 2026 Classic Cars\, Coffee\, & Cones at the Portsmouth
  Olde Towne Farmers Market Saturday\, june 20th | 10a-1:30p Located at the
  Courthouse and High St.\, Portsmouth. Join us for informal Classic Cars &
  Coffee at the historic Olde Towne Farmers Market every Saturday through D
 ecember 20th. Classic cars get FREE up-front\, car-show-style parking and 
 FREE gourmet coffee for the drivers. Great spot to bring the spouse and fa
 mily\, 50+ vendors with fresh produce\, grilled items\, baked goods\, swee
 ts\, juices\, confections\, even handmade jewelry and artisan items. Alway
