LOCATION:1780 Bridgeport Way\, Suffolk\, Virginia\, 23435
DESCRIPTION:Our events will be every 1st Friday of the month starting with 
 September 4th as our kickoff! Each 1st Friday\, Westside Burgers will turn
  back the clock to provide a vintage diner experience for our guests! The 
 Westside dining room will be themed into a classic 1950's diner\, with foo
 d and drink deals from 5pm-close\, as well as special decor and activities
 . We will also hold a limbo competition with $25 gift card for the winner.
  The first 25 guests will receive a coupon to use that evening for a $1.95
  plain hamburger. Deals will be held from 5pm until close or while supplie
 s last. To promote our theme\, we are asking the community to show off the
 ir vintage cars in the Westside lot! As well as securing a spot to our fun
  50's flashback\, drivers who bring their classic cars/hotrods will be gua
 ranteed a single $1.95 burger coupon for that evening. Of course\, there i
 s always the added bonus of bragging rights and chance to show off your ri
