 ustom builds | Freshly brewed coffee to kickstart your day* | Meet fellow 
 car enthusiasts and share stories | Music\, vibes\, vendors\, and more! Wh
 en: Every 2nd Sunday of each month (April - November) | Time: 830am - 11am
  | Where: 369 Chatham dr in Newport News Bring your car\, bring your frien
 ds\, and let's make it a morning to remember. All cars\, all makes\, and a
