BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:6aadae73507e2f79b9f28bf2@ccchr-dashboard.local
DTSTAMP:20261116T202950Z
DTSTART:20261114T140000Z
DTEND:20261114T200000Z
SUMMARY:Toys for Tots Hampton Roads Official Toy Collection Day and MCT All
  Makes and Models Car Show | Nov. 14th
LOCATION:Landstown Commons Shopping Center\, 3312 Princess Anne Road\, Virg
 inia Beach\, Virginia\, 23456
DESCRIPTION:The Mustang Club of Tidewater\, in conjunction with the US Mari
 ne Corps Reserve\, is proud to announce we will be holding our Third Annua
 l Marine Corps Reserve Toys for Tots Hampton Roads Official Toy Collection
  Day and Mustang Club of Tidewater All Makes and Models Car Show!! This sh
 ow is to support the Toys for Tots Hampton Roads program as they ramp up f
 or Christmas\, 2026. The car show is open to the public\, so bring your fa
 vorite car\, truck\, or bike/trike and help support your community!! We as
 k that you be generous in your donations of new\, unwrapped toys for boys 
 and girls in the Hampton Roads area. Click the header event image to see t
 he show flyer! Location: Landstown Commons Shopping Center\, 3312 Princess
  Anne Road\, Virginia Beach\, VA\, 23456 \, in the southwest parking lot a
 djacent to Princess Anne Road. Enter to the left of and behind Dollar Tree
 . Directional signs will be posted. Date/Times: November 14th\, 2026. - To
 ys for Tots Toy Collection by the USMC is from 9:00am until 2:30 pm\, when
  the awards presentation begins. - Car Show from 10:00a.m until 3:00p.m. -
  Registration for the Car Show and the Drive Through Toy Drop-Off Lane wil
 l both open at 9:00 a.m. Registration for the Car Show closes at 1:00 PM. 
 Judging will be completed by 1:30 PM. We invite you to participate as an e
 ntrant or spectator\, but if you cannot\, there will be a Drive-Through Dr
 op Off Lane for the community to make in person donations at the Toy Colle
 ction Event site!! To that end\, please pass the word to family\, friends\
 , and coworkers to help us collect as many toys as possible and other dona
 tions that we can\, in order to support the kids in Hampton Roads this hol
 iday season!!! Please keep in mind that all donations are kept and disburs
 ed here in the Hampton Roads area\, so we’re supporting our own communit
 y. Admission: The registration fee for vehicles entering the car show is $
 20\, plus at least 1 new\, unwrapped toy\, for donation to the Toys for To
 ts Hampton Roads program. The first 100 registered vehicles will receive a
  Dash Plaque for the show. We will be keeping tally of the number of toys 
 donated by each registrant and club/group. There is NO Pre-Registration fo
 r this show. All registration payments and toy collections will happen at 
 the show site. There is no charge for spectators to visit the show area\, 
 but we do ask that you make a toy or monetary donation to Toys for Tots wh
 ile visiting. Again\, please ignore any messages you may see asking you to
  pre-register\, as the MCT does not do pre-registration. Toy/Monetary Dona
 tions: There will be a designated drive through drop-off lane for communit
 y members to donate toys at the show location. If you can't make it to the
  event\, you can make a monetary donation directly to TFT by scanning the 
 QR Code on the event flyer. All donations will directly support operations
  in the Hampton Roads area. Music and Announcements: Will be provided by D
 J Vinlo! The US National Anthem will be played at Noon as we show respect 
 to the Flag of our Nation and thank the attending Marines and other milita
 ry members and veterans for their service! Show Details: This is a Partici
 pant's Choice show. All registered entrants will be provided with voting s
 lips to record their top 25 vehicle choices. Only one vote per vehicle on 
 your voting sheet. Please be fair in your selections! Spectators will rece
 ive a judging slip to pick their favorite vehicle. Awards will be made as 
 follows: - Best in Show - Marine Corps Reserve Toys for Tots Hampton Roads
  Choice - Most Toys Donated by Group/Club participating in the Car Show - 
 Most Toys Donated by an Individual participating in the Car Show - Top 25 
 Participant Choices based on Participant voting - Top Spectator Choice bas
 ed on Spectator voting Schedule for November 14th: - 0800: Set up show lot
 \, toy donation collection points\, and vendor displays. No show vehicles 
 will be admitted prior to 0830 (except for MCT and TFT members working the
  show). - 0900: Registration desk opens for the show. Toy collection begin
 s for car show participants\, show spectators\, and the public wishing to 
 make toy donations. - 1000: Car show officially starts. Participant and Sp
 ectator Judging begins. - 1030: Driver meeting with info on show\, vendors
  and other pertinent information. - 1200: National Anthem is played. All m
 ilitary vets and members recognized. - 1300: Car Show Registration Ends. T
 oy collection continues until 1430. - 1330: Car Show Judging Ends. Please 
 have your judging slips turned in by this time. - 1430: Toys for Tots Toy 
 Collection Ends. Award Presentations Begin\, 50/50 Drawing Held. - 1500: C
 ar Show Ends. Please depart in a safe and orderly manner. No Loud music\, 
 Burnouts\, or Exhibitions of Speed. This is a very busy shopping center th
 at grants us permission to use their parking area for shows. We don't want
  to risk losing this site. If you or your organization wish to be a Named 
 Sponsor for this show\, or you wish to set up as a vendor\, please send a 
 request to " mustangcluboftidewater67@yahoo.com " with your name\, organiz
 ation\, and contact information. Due to a non-compete clause with Landstow
 n Commons businesses\, we cannot allow certain food/drink vendors to parti
 cipate at this show. Our thanks to Arcadia Property Management the Car Clu
 b Council of Hampton Roads for arranging our use of the show site. The USM
 C Reserve Toys for Tots Staff and the members of the Mustang Club of Tidew
 ater thank everyone that will be attending and/or supporting this event. W
 e hope for a great turnout from our community! Thank you for participating
 ! You can see the event on our website calendar at https://www.mustangclub
 oftidewater.org/ or on Facebook at https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id
 =61571330402613 @media screen and (max-width: 767px) { } @media screen and
  (max-width: 767px) { } @media screen and (max-width: 767px) { }
END:VEVENT
